            "answer": ["17", "27", "70", "71"], "hints": ["Compare the tens first.", "70 and 71 have the same tens. Then compare ones."],
            "explanation": "17 (1 ten), 27 (2 tens), 70 (7 tens, 0 ones), 71 (7 tens, 1 one)." }
        ]}
      ]
    },
